Evolve-PixelVillage
===================

This project is a fork of Evolve (https://github.com/pmotschmann/Evolve), copyright Peter Motschmann
and contributors, licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Files of the original game that were modified in this fork (each remains under MPL-2.0):
  index.html
  src/vars.js
  src/main.js
  src/actions.js
  src/functions.js
  evolve/main.js            (rebuilt from src/ with esbuild)

Files added by this fork (offered under MPL-2.0 as well):
  kit/                      sprite kit (pixel pieces, procedural generator, village, citizens, world, ui, era 0 and era 1)
  atelier.html              sprite atelier
  evolve/pixel.css          pixel skin
  evolve/kitpixel.ttf       pixel font generated by tools/make-font.js from the kit's bitmap font
  anki-village.js           village view host script
  anki-skin.js              skin image loader
  serve.js, jouer.sh        local offline server and Termux helper
  tools/, kit-patches/      developer tools and patches
  project-docs/             audits, method, prompts, screenshots
  lib/jquery.min.js, vue.min.js, buefy.min.js, popper.min.js, Sortable.min.js, chart.min.js
                            third-party libraries vendored from unpkg (same versions and integrity hashes as upstream's index.html):
                            jquery 3.6.3 (MIT), vue 2.7.14 (MIT), buefy 0.9.22 (MIT), @popperjs/core 2.9.2 (MIT),
                            sortablejs 1.10.2 (MIT), chart.js 3.8.2 (MIT)

The sprite kit was designed with Claude Design and the integration code was written with Claude Code (Anthropic).
This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the author of Evolve.
